OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,6,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain and
OL,7,Fhill snow, turning heavy at times.
OL,8,FWindy in the morning with strong east
OL,9,Fto southeasterly winds, easing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with further
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain, but turning
OL,14,Fgenerally lighter and more patchy as
OL,15,Fwinds ease overnight. Turning heavier
OL,16,Fagain in southwest towards morning.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FIt will stay cloudy with
OL,19,Ffurther outbreaks of rain, mostly
OL,20,Flight and patchy in the east, but
OL,21,Fheavier at times in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
